{#
  Wallet balance chip in the top bar (item 17). The single source of truth for the balance
  in the chrome — the avatar dropdown and the hamburger panel only link to the page, so
  this component still renders exactly once per request (one wallet SELECT).
  `credits_buy` (/kredity/koupit) is POST-only — it is the Stripe checkout action — so the
  chip points at the credits page and its „Dobít kredity" card, which holds that form.
#}
<a href="{{ path('credits') }}#dobit"
   class="credit-chip"
   title="Kredity — dobít"
   aria-label="Kredity: {{ this.balance }}. Dobít kredity.">
    <twig:ux:icon name="lucide:wallet" class="h-4 w-4 text-accent-300" />
    <span>{{ this.balance }}</span>
</a>
